<%# The Creator Lab moment (plan section 11): its podcasters lose their marketplace on November 1. Names are used only to
    describe what happened (no logos, never "official" or "replacement"), with the not-affiliated line the research
    asks for (research/podcorn-plan.md). The tense follows the date (LandingHelper#landing_creator_lab_line). %>
<section id="creator-lab" class="page-section" aria-labelledby="creator-lab-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="creator-lab">
      <h2 id="creator-lab-title" class="type-h2">Coming from Creator Lab?</h2>
      <p class="section-lead"><%= landing_creator_lab_line %> List your show free.</p>
      <ul class="creator-lab-points">
        <li>Free to list, claim and verify</li>
        <li>No commission on any deal</li>
        <li>Brands ask, you choose</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <%= ui_button "Find your show", podcasts_path %>
      </div>
      <p class="creator-lab-note">Midrolo is an independent tool. We are not affiliated with Audacy, Creator Lab or Podcorn.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
